            },
            "completionRequires": [
              "debug-context.md and debug-work-order.md contain every user-requested item and initialize the fixed Debug Capsule fields with available user, log, and code evidence before investigation.",
              "Record a task inventory for every user-requested item, with symptom, expected/actual behavior, evidence, suspected entry points, and accepted or explicitly deferred status.",
              "Record whether tasks share a suspected root cause or are independent; do not merge them without evidence.",
              "Record dependencies, target files, write scopes, validation cases, and any bounded question needed to confirm the inventory.",
              "Handoff the complete Debug Capsule and task inventory; ask only one unresolved material question per AskUserQuestion call."
            ]
