              "Record one problem-report entry for every accepted task: task id, reproduction status, evidence, root-cause finding or uncertainty, impact, and minimal fix path.",
              "Record why tasks were grouped or kept separate, including dependency, write-scope, and shared-resource reasoning for parallel investigation batches.",
              "Never silently omit a remaining accepted task; record an explicit user deferral or blocker instead.",
              "Handoff the updated Debug Capsule so debug-fix receives verified facts, excluded causes, root cause, and the smallest repair path without full chat history."
            ]
