              "Record one fix-log entry for every accepted task: task id, batch, changed files, fix summary, tests/checks, reviewer feedback, and terminal status.",
              "Record dependency, write-scope, and shared-resource reasoning for every parallel batch.",
              "Never silently omit a remaining accepted task; record an explicit user deferral, could-not-reproduce outcome, or blocker instead.",
              "Handoff the Debug Capsule with root cause, fix, changed files, Coder evidence, Reviewer result, and remaining regression work."
